					</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  Renewals or extensions of this certificate of final electrical inspection (CFEI) are subject to inspection and payment of corresponding fees in conformity with pertinent provisions of the latest Philippine electrical codes, the national building code (pd 1096) and its implementing rules and regulations.]]></text>
				</staticText>
